      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why is this check necessary?\n\nIs the implication that callers are incorrectly writing `0` bytes today already and we want to disable that?\n\nIt seems possible someone is \"flushing\" already by writing `0` bytes, and this CL is removing that behavior which may have unintended consequences.",
